<title>BRAZIL: Foreigners said to show interest in Brazil Banerj.</title>
<headline>Foreigners said to show interest in Brazil Banerj.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven large financial institutions, including foreign banks, are interested in taking part in the privatisation auction of Rio de Janeiro state bank Banerj, Finance Minister Pedro Malan was reported as saying.</p>
<p>The names of institutions that have prequalified to participate in the December 12 sale are to be announced November 4 by its administrators, private invest bank Bozano Simonsen, private Invest News agency said.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
